<title>CHINA: HK provisional May-Jul unemployment 2.4 pct.</title>
<headline>HK provisional May-Jul unemployment 2.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Census and Statistics Department gave the following seasonally adjusted figures on Friday as percentages of the total workforce:</p>
<p>		     May-Jul*  Apr-Jun   Jan-Mar   Apr-Jun</p>
<p>			 1997	1997	1997	1996</p>
<p> Unemployment	2.4	 2.4	 2.5	 3.1</p>
<p> Underemployment   1.2	 1.3**     1.1	 1.8</p>
<p>* = provisional</p>
<p>**= revised</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
